WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:04.710 --> 01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.710 --> 01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.880 --> 01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:13.880 --> 01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:42.240 --> 01:50.540
THE TERRIFYING CURSE FIELD

01:50.710 --> 01:55.840
Bye-bye little Princess.
Go act tough on your way to the afterlife!

02:01.800 --> 02:02.930
Dai?!

02:03.560 --> 02:04.930
Get away from Leona!

02:06.480 --> 02:08.140
Save it for someone who cares!

02:12.940 --> 02:17.400
If you even touch Leona, you'll regret it!

02:17.780 --> 02:18.950
Dai!

02:21.370 --> 02:23.490
You little brat!

02:29.210 --> 02:32.170
Dai jumped off and charged in alone!

02:32.330 --> 02:35.500
Once we land let's charge in, too!

02:35.670 --> 02:38.090
Baduck, stay here and keep watch.

02:38.260 --> 02:38.840
Huh?

02:39.340 --> 02:42.300
Have the Balloon Ship ready to launch!

02:42.680 --> 02:43.600
Yes, Lady!

02:50.640 --> 02:52.900
I'll regret it?!

02:53.480 --> 02:54.690
Cocky little brat!

02:58.240 --> 03:01.820
Just try to hurt me if you can!

03:07.750 --> 03:08.580
Why you...!

03:18.010 --> 03:20.420
<i>He's fast! Could it be...?!</i>

03:20.760 --> 03:23.680
I'm going to avenge Hyunckel, too!

03:23.840 --> 03:27.220
In your dreams, you snotty brat!

03:27.390 --> 03:28.270
Kacrackle!

03:28.770 --> 03:29.810
Dai!

03:35.150 --> 03:37.400
Freeze! Freeze!

03:57.540 --> 03:59.300
What is that sword?!

04:03.180 --> 04:04.640
Magic Sword!

04:04.800 --> 04:06.140
What?!

04:06.800 --> 04:08.100
Oh wow!

04:08.760 --> 04:09.810
Take this!

04:10.520 --> 04:12.180
Fire Earth Slash!

04:21.610 --> 04:22.860
Dammit!

04:29.990 --> 04:35.500
<i>I was right!
No wonder he beat Crocodine and Hyunckel!</i>

04:35.750 --> 04:38.540
<i>In his battles
with the other Legion Commanders...</i>

04:39.550 --> 04:45.880
<i>the little brat's combat skills
have leveled up unbelievably!</i>

04:46.930 --> 04:48.350
<i>This might be...</i>

04:48.640 --> 04:50.850
<i>time for my trump card!</i>

04:51.810 --> 04:55.520
<i>Oh wow! Oh wow, Dai!</i>

04:56.270 --> 04:59.440
<i>You've learned to properly use magic.</i>

04:59.820 --> 05:01.980
<i>I'm a little relieved.</i>

05:02.150 --> 05:03.030
Dai!

05:05.320 --> 05:07.740
Popp, Maam, Miss Amy!

05:08.030 --> 05:09.160
Help everyone!

05:09.780 --> 05:10.990
Hang in there!

05:13.250 --> 05:14.250
Apollo!

05:14.410 --> 05:17.370
A-Amy, help Marin first!

05:17.540 --> 05:18.580
What?!

05:19.840 --> 05:21.050
Sister!

05:24.840 --> 05:26.840
That bastard did all this?!

05:27.010 --> 05:30.510
But it looks like
we've got the upper hand, huh?

05:30.760 --> 05:31.890
Don't let your guard down!

05:42.020 --> 05:48.530
I get it. You're a much bigger fish
than that little princess!

05:48.700 --> 05:49.450
Huh?!

05:53.240 --> 05:55.540
H-His arm grew back?!

05:55.700 --> 05:58.120
Your head is mine!

06:15.770 --> 06:17.060
Everybody, get down!

06:21.020 --> 06:22.560
Blizzblaze Shrapnel Detonation!

06:49.220 --> 06:50.090
Leona!

06:50.800 --> 06:53.470
It hurts! It hurts bad!

06:53.890 --> 06:57.140
You're not the only one in pain, dummy!

06:57.310 --> 06:59.600
Stop crying and help everyone!

07:00.100 --> 07:02.730
It'll take more than that to beat us!

07:04.650 --> 07:06.570
You've already lost.

07:06.730 --> 07:07.740
What?!

07:07.900 --> 07:14.530
That little thing was both an attack
and a signal to my servants...

07:14.700 --> 07:17.240
to begin an infernal battle.

07:17.410 --> 07:19.790
What was that blast?!

07:20.870 --> 07:23.960
Hey! You need my help down there?!

07:25.590 --> 07:26.710
An earthquake?!

07:32.430 --> 07:33.680
What's that?!

07:53.490 --> 07:55.070
W-What in the world?!

07:56.240 --> 07:57.370
Huh?!

08:07.210 --> 08:10.170
What is it?! What's happening?!

08:11.630 --> 08:13.970
The Dark Flame Spire is complete!

08:15.340 --> 08:17.640
The Dark Ice Spire is complete, too!

08:22.560 --> 08:26.860
And now, let's begin
our entertaining showtime!

09:11.690 --> 09:13.030
The shaking stopped!

09:18.530 --> 09:20.780
What was that?! What did you do?!

09:25.210 --> 09:27.670
The Blizzblaze Curse Field!

09:28.130 --> 09:30.500
Blizzblaze... Curse Field?

09:31.130 --> 09:36.970
It's the ultimate tactic that's made
my Blizzblaze Legion unbeatable!

09:37.380 --> 09:40.600
You're all out of options now!

09:40.930 --> 09:45.980
All you can do now is scramble around
until you're all slaughtered!

09:46.140 --> 09:51.900
Get real! You can't slaughter us
with just a little shaking!

09:52.070 --> 09:53.940
Then give it a shot.

09:54.110 --> 09:57.700
Fine! Cry and beg all you like,
but it's over for you!

09:58.410 --> 09:59.530
Sizz!

10:02.450 --> 10:03.330
Huh?

10:03.740 --> 10:04.700
Sizz!

10:05.000 --> 10:07.870
What's this?! What's going on?!

10:08.290 --> 10:10.330
My spell... I can't cast Sizz!

10:10.500 --> 10:11.590
Frizz!

10:12.880 --> 10:15.010
C-could it be...?!

10:15.170 --> 10:16.800
He's nullified our magic?!

10:16.970 --> 10:20.090
I guess you haven't gotten the rules yet.

10:31.520 --> 10:34.940
<i>It's like... It's like
my strength is gone!</i>

10:35.320 --> 10:36.780
C'mere!

10:48.370 --> 10:49.000
Dai!

10:49.160 --> 10:53.790
What's going on?!
How did Flazzard suddenly get so strong?!

10:57.670 --> 11:02.760
That's not it. I haven't gotten stronger.

11:03.180 --> 11:05.350
So what is it then?

11:07.730 --> 11:10.980
You've all gotten weaker!

11:12.980 --> 11:14.400
What?!

11:14.820 --> 11:16.980
That Dark Flame Spire...

11:17.440 --> 11:19.820
and that Dark Ice Spire...

11:20.240 --> 11:23.120
act on the core inside my body...

11:23.410 --> 11:28.290
and encase this entire area
with a powerful field!

11:29.250 --> 11:31.250
Within this field,

11:31.420 --> 11:36.710
everybody but me is weakened
and can't use spells.

11:36.880 --> 11:42.800
Basically, right now, this kid
is weaker than a normal human.

11:43.140 --> 11:44.010
What?!

11:44.180 --> 11:47.180
Looks like you finally get the rules!

11:48.350 --> 11:51.100
Th-That's cheating, Flazzard!

11:51.270 --> 11:54.520
Can't you fight fair and square?!

11:54.690 --> 11:56.650
Save me the sermon.

11:56.900 --> 12:00.030
I don't like fighting.

12:01.280 --> 12:05.700
Winning is what I like!

12:09.790 --> 12:12.040
Slaughter time! Here I come!

12:30.140 --> 12:34.060
<i>It's no good!
My Magic Bullet Gun doesn't work!</i>

12:38.020 --> 12:40.530
AVAN STRASH

12:42.990 --> 12:45.530
FIVE FINGER FLARES

12:51.540 --> 12:54.500
Miss Amy, is your sister alright?!

12:54.670 --> 12:58.380
She's alive. But I can't cast Heal!

12:58.540 --> 13:02.010
At this rate, my sister and Apollo
and everyone will die!

13:14.640 --> 13:16.690
Dai, we have to run!

13:16.850 --> 13:18.690
What?! What are you talking about, Maam?!

13:19.230 --> 13:24.860
We have to save the survivors and
take the Balloon Ship outside the field!

13:25.030 --> 13:26.410
It's our only option!

13:26.570 --> 13:30.410
No! I don't want to lose to that cheater!

13:30.780 --> 13:32.830
So long as you survive, you haven't lost!

13:33.000 --> 13:36.170
But at this rate, we'll all be wiped out!

13:39.040 --> 13:40.710
I'll give you a choice.

13:40.880 --> 13:42.920
Want to be frozen solid?

13:43.550 --> 13:46.380
Or turned into a cinder?

13:46.550 --> 13:47.590
No!

13:47.760 --> 13:50.390
No! We can't run!

13:50.550 --> 13:51.640
What?!

13:52.140 --> 13:54.390
Dai, stop being stubborn!

13:55.270 --> 13:56.810
I'm not running!

13:56.980 --> 13:58.600
Damn straight you're not!

14:04.740 --> 14:05.820
Leona!

14:06.280 --> 14:11.780
I just put up the field.
I can't have you running now!

14:11.950 --> 14:13.080
Stop!

14:13.240 --> 14:17.410
Let's make it so you don't even think
about running away!

14:38.640 --> 14:39.690
Princess!

14:51.740 --> 14:53.490
Leona!

14:54.120 --> 14:59.960
There. You like that?
The Princess of Papnica in ice.

15:00.120 --> 15:05.000
Don't worry, though.
She's still alive in there!

15:08.380 --> 15:12.510
I used Legendary Forbidden Magic
to freeze her.

15:12.680 --> 15:16.770
No blow can shatter it
and no spell can melt it.

15:16.930 --> 15:20.140
So what are you supposed to do?

15:20.310 --> 15:22.230
You have to beat me.

15:22.400 --> 15:25.320
Kill me, and the ice melts!

15:25.770 --> 15:28.440
So, do you still want to run?

15:28.610 --> 15:32.360
You can't abandon your little princess
and flee like mice...

15:32.530 --> 15:33.570
Can you?

15:34.160 --> 15:37.040
It's hard being a Hero, huh?!

15:51.260 --> 15:52.800
-Darn it!
-Dai!

15:53.840 --> 15:55.510
There you go!

15:56.010 --> 15:57.770
Just like that!

15:58.390 --> 16:00.600
Come and be killed!

16:00.770 --> 16:01.600
Popp!

16:01.770 --> 16:02.810
Y-Yeah?

16:03.520 --> 16:06.400
Help Miss Amy and get everyone
to the Balloon Ship!

16:06.570 --> 16:07.730
We're running?!

16:07.900 --> 16:09.690
No! We can't abandon the Princess!

16:11.200 --> 16:14.110
At this rate, we'll just be slaughtered!

16:14.280 --> 16:16.830
We have to get out
and wait for an opportunity!

16:18.660 --> 16:20.000
Help us, Baduck!

16:20.160 --> 16:21.250
R-Right!

16:21.750 --> 16:23.210
Sister, hang in there!

16:24.210 --> 16:25.000
Darn it!

16:41.430 --> 16:42.270
How's that?!

16:42.940 --> 16:46.230
Ooh. That's impressive.

16:46.860 --> 16:49.730
You've still got
that much strength in you.

16:51.490 --> 16:57.160
In this field, my enemies' strength
becomes one fifth what it was.

16:59.410 --> 17:03.580
In other words, normally, that blow
would be five times stronger.

17:03.750 --> 17:05.500
Talk about scary.

17:06.750 --> 17:07.790
But...

17:10.550 --> 17:14.930
in here, it'll never amount
to a mortal wound!

17:15.090 --> 17:17.340
Dai, we have to escape!

17:17.510 --> 17:21.100
Don't be stupid!
You saw what he did to Leona!

17:21.470 --> 17:25.350
So long as you're alive,
he won't kill the Princess!

17:25.810 --> 17:27.560
We should escape and formulate a plan!

17:27.730 --> 17:30.150
No! I'm...

17:30.820 --> 17:31.980
I'm...

17:32.320 --> 17:34.650
I'm fighting to the end!

17:34.820 --> 17:37.990
That's right. Come on, big Hero.

17:48.130 --> 17:49.960
What the hell?!

17:55.880 --> 17:57.300
I'm sorry, Dai!

17:57.470 --> 17:59.050
Maam, hurry!

18:00.850 --> 18:03.270
Like hell! You're going nowhere!

18:03.430 --> 18:04.980
How about...

18:05.140 --> 18:06.850
Kafrizz!

18:07.350 --> 18:08.230
...this!

18:18.240 --> 18:19.070
Now!

18:19.240 --> 18:19.950
Right!

18:32.710 --> 18:34.000
Why that little...!

18:35.010 --> 18:37.340
What the heck was that explosion?

18:38.050 --> 18:39.550
A bullet from my Magic Bullet Gun.

18:39.890 --> 18:42.810
I threw a bullet with a Sizz spell in it.

18:45.470 --> 18:49.020
Flazzard's Kafrizz set it off.

18:49.480 --> 18:51.690
That's smart thinking.

18:52.110 --> 18:54.570
Lady Amy, where shall we go?

18:54.730 --> 18:55.900
Head north.

18:56.070 --> 18:57.240
North it is.

18:57.400 --> 19:00.360
There's a rocky coast
where we should be able to hide.

19:04.240 --> 19:06.580
Dancing Flame Army of the Dark Flame Spire!

19:06.750 --> 19:09.790
Knock them out of the sky!
Don't let them off the island!

19:13.420 --> 19:16.760
Wait right there, little Princess.

19:17.550 --> 19:21.510
He ain't the sort of Hero
to abandon you, is he?

19:24.140 --> 19:28.180
Normally, I feel like running
the moment it gets dangerous.

19:28.850 --> 19:31.400
But not this time.

19:32.150 --> 19:35.480
I wish I could have done something
to save the Princess.

19:35.650 --> 19:37.030
I'm sorry.

19:38.690 --> 19:39.740
But...

19:40.400 --> 19:42.780
I know, Maam.

19:42.950 --> 19:48.160
If you hadn't done what you did,
we'd have been wiped out by now.

19:50.290 --> 19:51.250
Yeah.

19:51.420 --> 19:53.040
Everyone, look!

19:57.210 --> 19:58.010
Pursuers!

20:01.220 --> 20:03.760
Get us out of here, old timer!
At full speed!

20:03.930 --> 20:05.050
R-Right!

20:05.970 --> 20:06.970
Kacrack!

20:08.970 --> 20:12.440
Everybody, we're out of the field,
so we can use magic!

20:13.900 --> 20:14.520
Crackle!

20:22.070 --> 20:26.240
Even so, there's too many of them!

20:30.620 --> 20:32.870
We're going to fall into the whirlpool!

20:33.040 --> 20:34.580
I've got this!

20:35.130 --> 20:37.460
Our altitude keeps dropping!

20:37.960 --> 20:39.590
It's all over!

20:39.760 --> 20:40.960
We're crashing?!

20:41.340 --> 20:42.420
Don't give up!

21:02.570 --> 21:04.660
Get us to shore!

21:06.660 --> 21:08.410
Drop the weights!

21:22.840 --> 21:23.800
Over there!

21:23.970 --> 21:27.550
A light came from there and saved us!

21:27.930 --> 21:29.260
Let's go!

21:33.520 --> 21:34.350
We're here.

21:35.350 --> 21:37.810
Who's there? The fools from the balloon?

21:37.980 --> 21:39.110
Uh, yes!

21:39.270 --> 21:41.980
If you're all okay
then feel free to leave.

21:42.150 --> 21:43.110
Huh? Um...

21:44.110 --> 21:44.950
Leave.

21:45.110 --> 21:48.660
Please! You have to help us!

21:48.820 --> 21:51.540
I don't want anything to do with anyone.

21:52.910 --> 21:54.910
Y-You!

21:55.080 --> 21:55.750
Hm?

21:56.250 --> 21:57.670
Uncle Matoriv!

21:58.460 --> 21:59.840
Hmm?

22:20.190 --> 22:25.940
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

22:20.190 --> 22:25.940
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

22:26.110 --> 22:32.950
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

22:26.110 --> 22:32.950
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

22:33.120 --> 22:36.160
<i>I'm not sure</i>

22:33.120 --> 22:36.160
<i>doudarou</i>

22:38.460 --> 22:44.130
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

22:38.460 --> 22:44.130
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

22:44.300 --> 22:46.670
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

22:44.300 --> 22:46.670
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

22:46.840 --> 22:52.810
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

22:46.840 --> 22:52.810
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

22:53.260 --> 22:57.480
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

22:53.260 --> 22:57.480
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

22:57.640 --> 23:01.690
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

22:57.640 --> 23:01.690
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

23:01.860 --> 23:08.150
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

23:01.860 --> 23:08.150
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

23:08.320 --> 23:13.990
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

23:08.320 --> 23:13.990
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

23:14.160 --> 23:19.290
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

23:14.160 --> 23:19.290
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

23:34.180 --> 23:37.020
<i>Dai and his friends were saved
from Flazzard's pursuers</i>

23:37.180 --> 23:40.850
<i>by Matoriv, a Mage
living as a hermit in a cave.</i>

23:41.560 --> 23:47.360
<i>They work on a plan to break
the Forbidden Magic and save Leona.</i>

23:47.530 --> 23:52.490
<i>Meanwhile, Hadlar and his Dark Army
begin suspicious preparations.</i>

23:52.950 --> 23:55.370
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

23:55.530 --> 23:57.410
<i>"The Grand Sorcerer Matoriv"</i>

23:57.580 --> 23:59.540
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

23:59.540 --> 24:01.540


24:01.540 --> 24:03.510

